OL,3,AKarl Bushby 'overwhelmed' at Humber
OL,4,ABridge welcome
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish adventurer Karl Bushby crossed
OL,7,Fthe Humber Bridge through thick mist on
OL,8,Fthe final leg of his 31,000-mile
OL,9,F(49,890 km), 28-year trek from South
OL,10,FAmerica to Hull.
OL,12,FBushby left Chile in 1998 to head home
OL,13,Fto the UK without breaking two
OL,14,Fself-imposed rules: not to return to
OL,15,Fthe UK until he had completed his
OL,16,Fjourney, and not to use transport to
OL,17,Fadvance.
OL,19,FThe adventurer said he was "absolutely
OL,20,Foverwhelmed" by the crowds who lined
OL,21,Fthe bridge.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
