OL,3,AKarl Bushby 'overwhelmed' at Humber
OL,4,ABridge welcome
OL,5,
OL,6,FBushby, a former paratrooper, is due to
OL,7,Fcomplete the challenge on Monday and
OL,8,Fwill be met by his mother, his son and
OL,9,Fgranddaughter when he arrives in Hull.
